      "record": "# 05 — Recorded orientation trial t2\nversion:001\nwho:Codex Prime\nstate:returned and assessed\nFace:05\nPPPP:0507\nbook:00.00.10.work\n\n## Scope and actual authorization\nThis card records an ALREADY RUN trial and its review, not a retroactively released\nbuild pack. Director said \"fresh claude is running\" then \"Good, the prime test is\ndone.\" The candidate reports reading the supplied LAUNCH-PROMPT and trial inputs.\nExact initial chat text/full transcript were not supplied; do not invent them.\nPreparation:0507/05.16, sealed0151, actual external attempt t2. Formal evaluator and\nPrime launch boundary were fixed before answers. Candidate is not appointed Prime.\n\n## Result\nMechanical O1–O6 checks ok. O1–O5 semantic pass; O6 content sound but protocol wrong:\ncandidate disclosed extra shell operations forbidden by fixed evaluator(f).\nJudge:not-oriented; authority none. Outside memory note also disclosed; influence\non answers unknown, no evaluator read alleged. See evidence/trial-t2/review.md.\n\n## Return and custody\nCapture member/receipt will be appended after verification. All candidate evidence\nretained as exact copies; this page does not alter the source answers/preparation.\n\nReserved member:0153.prime-orientation-trial-t2. Receipt and verify are recorded in the separate capture result.\n",
